# ---- Sample/clinical data — real OR synthetic — must never be committed ----
# By project convention ALL sample data uses the .mock extension.
*.mock
# mockdata/ holds sample data, derived review workbooks, and any
# partner-shared documents — never commit any of it, except the folder's
# own explanatory README.
mockdata/*
!mockdata/README.md
*.large

# Session handoff notes — local only, never committed.
HANDOFF.md
HANDOFF-*.md

